<title>CANADA: Gulf Canada sets special preferred dividend.</title>
<headline>Gulf Canada sets special preferred dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf Canada Resources Ltd said on Monday it would pay a special dividend of C$0.01 a share on its fixed/adjustable rate senior preference shares, series 1, on December 12.</p>
<p>Gulf said the special payout, to shareholders of record at the close of business on November 29, was part of its plan to pay dividend arrears.  </p>
<p>The company also said its regular November dividend rate for the preference shares was calculated at C$0.016 per share, also payable on December 12.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
